      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785505946567,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NOTE: TCP retransmits a segment if its \"Retransmission Timeout (RTO)\" expires before ACK is received",
      "fontSize": 28.541816502925965,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NOTE: TCP retransmits a segment if its \"Retransmission Timeout (RTO)\" expires before ACK is received",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "evs463y6NXEVEMUbqj_3W",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1402.3146627914693,
      "y": 17199.131401249826,
      "width": 1225.3155012466389,
      "height": 217.1848931939515,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cJEN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 921300559,
      "version": 818,
      "versionNonce": 1080747197,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785505946567,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Maanlo sender ne segment send kar diya but dur to netwoek latency receiver tak late\npahucha like RTO ho gaya to sender ko laga ki reciver tk segment pohcha hi nhi kyunki\nreceiver ne ackowlegement send karne me der kardi due to latency so sender firse wo\nsegment bhejega (e.g. HELLO) so recever get that segment also then wo check karega\nki current(new segment HELLO seq no.4 ) seq number mere paas hai ki nhi so receiver\nke paas pehle se hi HELLO pahuch gaya tha so it will discard the new segment ",
      "fontSize": 28.95798575919353,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Maanlo sender ne segment send kar diya but dur to netwoek latency receiver tak late pahucha like RTO ho gaya to sender ko laga ki reciver tk segment pohcha hi nhi kyunki receiver ne ackowlegement send karne me der kardi due to latency so sender firse wo segment bhejega (e.g. HELLO) so recever get that segment also then wo check karega ki current(new segment HELLO seq no.4 ) seq number mere paas hai ki nhi so receiver ke paas pehle se hi HELLO pahuch gaya tha so it will discard the new segment ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yaVSOThORCur__JW_kk8E",
      "type": "text",
